00:36:14.417 --> 00:36:17.357
To bring it back to Muse, that would be
an example of, "I understand you want

00:36:17.358 --> 00:36:20.078
this doctor's appointment. I understand
that you don't want me to blackmail

00:36:20.078 --> 00:36:23.487
