00:36:53.537 --> 00:36:58.337
deploy agents worldwide scale, and then
they, you know, they aren't behaving

00:36:58.337 --> 00:37:01.067
the way that we need them to, but
we kind of don't even notice because

00:37:01.067 --> 00:37:03.287
we're just so preoccupied or whatnot.

00:37:03.497 --> 00:37:07.747
So this is one of the reasons why
taking a step back, if I refer back

00:37:07.747 --> 00:37:12.417
to this example of, um, scalable
oversight, which is as the AIs get

00:37:12.418 --> 00:37:15.327
smarter, another AI is kind of watching
