00:37:15.327 --> 00:37:17.217
they're doing is, is appropriate.

00:37:17.448 --> 00:37:23.052
Um, you know, this kind of setup
is- Roughly speaking, what we've set

00:37:23.052 --> 00:37:25.422
up within the Muse, uh, secure VM.

