00:37:30.212 --> 00:37:33.902
all the things that the main agent
is doing and making sure that, um,

00:37:34.012 --> 00:37:37.642
everything it's doing is, is, um,
in line with what you would expect

00:37:37.642 --> 00:37:38.771
or in line with what you'd want.

00:37:38.811 --> 00:37:42.912
You know, we have to keep investing a
lot of research and development and,

00:37:43.092 --> 00:37:47.122
and, um, effort into ensuring that this
setup continues to scale and continues

00:37:47.131 --> 00:37:51.262
to work really effectively and, and
doesn't fail in weird situations.

00:37:51.301 --> 00:37:55.901
But that's one thing I really wanna, I
really, um, we're really betting on, and

00:37:55.901 --> 00:37:59.942
I think we're expecting actually will
work in a lot of scenarios, is investing

00:37:59.942 --> 00:38:05.611
in a setup where you have one agent who,
